---
const seerSayings = [
  "The images that return are not accidents; they are invitations.",
  "You do not dream in words, yet your dreams speak in sentences.",
  "Every symbol you resist has already chosen you.",
  "The dream is not a story you watch; it is a mirror you enter.",
  "You are not here to decode the dream. You are here to let it rearrange you.",
  "The dream does not ask for your agreement; it asks for your attention.",
  "What you call a nightmare is often a message that refused to whisper.",
  "The smallest detail in a dream can be the loudest voice in your life.",
  "You wake up, but the dream does not end; it moves into your day as a pattern.",
  "Every recurring image is a door that has not yet been opened.",
  "You do not have to understand a symbol for it to begin working on you.",
  "The dream is not trying to solve your problems; it is trying to reveal your position.",
  "When you chase meaning too quickly, you outrun the message.",
  "The dream speaks in exaggerations so that your waking mind cannot ignore it.",
  "You are not the author of your dreams; you are the listener.",
  "The dream remembers what you have forgotten about yourself.",
  "Every figure in your dream carries a piece of your own voice.",
  "The dream is not linear; it is layered. You are allowed to return to it.",
  "You cannot control what appears in your dreams, but you can choose how gently you receive it.",
  "The dream does not punish; it exposes.",
  "When a place appears again and again, it is not geography—it is a state of soul.",
  "The dream often hides its clearest message in the strangest image.",
  "You are not meant to decode everything; you are meant to notice what will not let you go.",
  "The dream is a rehearsal space for truths you are not yet ready to speak aloud.",
  "Every animal in a dream carries instinct, memory, and a direction.",
  "The dream does not flatter you; it shows you where you are divided.",
  "You cannot outrun a symbol that has chosen you; you can only learn to walk with it.",
  "The dream is not a test; it is a conversation.",
  "When you wake disturbed, it is often because the dream has touched something true.",
  "The dream does not care about your schedule; it arrives when your defenses are lowest.",
  "You are not alone in your dreams; parts of you you have not met yet are already there.",
  "The dream is a night‑language; translation requires patience, not force.",
  "Every door in a dream is a question: what are you willing to enter?",
  "The dream repeats what you ignore.",
  "You cannot bargain with a symbol; you can only listen to its timing.",
  "The dream is not random; it is precise in ways that are not yet obvious.",
  "When you dismiss a dream, you often dismiss a part of yourself.",
  "The dream is a mirror that does not care about your self‑image.",
  "You are not here to conquer your dreams; you are here to be changed by them.",
  "The dream often speaks first in feeling, and only later in words.",
  "Every unresolved story in your life writes itself into your dreams.",
  "The dream is a night‑map of your loyalties and your fears.",
  "You do not have to share your dream for it to be real; its reality is in its effect on you.",
  "The dream is a place where your future self sometimes visits your present.",
  "When you remember a dream years later, it is because its work is not finished.",
  "The dream is not a puzzle to solve; it is a relationship to tend.",
  "You are not wrong for being confused; the dream arrives before the explanation.",
  "The dream is a lantern in a room you did not know you had.",
  "Every symbol that embarrasses you is asking for a more honest conversation.",
  "The dream does not speak in moral judgments; it speaks in images of imbalance.",
  "You are allowed to be gentle with what your dream reveals.",
  "The dream is not trying to fix you; it is trying to show you where you are already moving.",
  "When you listen to your dreams, you become less surprised by your life.",
  "The dream is a night‑oracle; it will not shout, but it will repeat.",
  "You are not here to tame your dreams; you are here to recognize their authority.",
  "The dream often answers questions you did not know you were asking.",
  "Every symbol that frightens you is also a doorway to courage.",
  "The dream is a living archive of your inner negotiations.",
  "You do not dream alone; your ancestors sometimes speak in your images.",
  "The dream is not a distraction; it is a parallel briefing.",
  "You are allowed to take one sentence from a dream and carry it for a year.",
  "The dream is a night‑mirror; it shows you the shape of your unseen commitments."
];

function pickSaying() {
  return seerSayings[Math.floor(Math.random() * seerSayings.length)];
}
---

<style>
  body {
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, #1a1633 0, #050514 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 100%, #120a24 0, #050514 60%);
    color: #e9e3ff;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .seer-stars {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .seer-star {
    position: absolute;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f3c97a;
    opacity: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(243, 201, 122, 0.8);
    animation: star-fade 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes star-fade {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.7); }
    25%  { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(1); }
    50%  { opacity: 0.2; transform: scale(0.9); }
    75%  { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.05); }
    100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.7); }
  }

  main.seer-main {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1120px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .seer-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .seer-title-row {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .seer-title-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #050514 0%, #050514 30%, #f3c97a 31%, #f3c97a 55%, #8f7fff 56%, #8f7fff 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(199, 179, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .seer-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #C7B3FF;
  }

  .seer-subtitle {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    color: #b9b1e8;
  }

  .seer-divider {
    margin: 1.6rem auto 0;
    width: 180px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      rgba(243, 201, 122, 0),
      rgba(243, 201, 122, 0.7),
      rgba(243, 201, 122, 0)
    );
  }

  .seer-eye-apex {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 2rem 0 2.2rem;
  }

  .seer-svg-wrap {
    animation: seer-bob 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .seer-svg {
    width: clamp(160px, 22vw, 240px);
    height: auto;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(157, 127, 255, 0.55))
      drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(106, 75, 255, 0.45));
  }

  @keyframes seer-bob {
    0%   { transform: translateY(0px); }
    25%  { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    50%  { transform: translateY(0px); }
    75%  { transform: translateY(6px); }
    100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
  }

  .seer-base-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .seer-base-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .seer-panel {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, #1c1436 0, #0b0718 55%);
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(243, 201, 122, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 1.9rem;
  }

  .seer-panel-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #C7B3FF;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .seer-panel-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #cbc4f3;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .seer-input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 90px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 179, 255, 0.35);
    background: rgba(5, 5, 20, 0.85);
    color: #e9e3ff;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .seer-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  .seer-button {
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(243, 201, 122, 0.7);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 0%, #f3c97a 0, #b27bff 40%, #6a4bff 100%);
    color: #120a24;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.6rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .seer-output-shell {
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 179, 255, 0.35);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #241a42 0, #0b0718 60%);
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    min-height: 80px;
  }

  .seer-output-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(199, 179, 255, 0.8);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .seer-output-text span {
    opacity: 0;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .seer-output-text span.revealed {
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.06s ease;
  }

  .seer-output-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -40%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(106, 75, 255, 0.18) 0, transparent 60%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
  }

  .seer-output-shell.active .seer-output-glow {
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>

<div class="seer-stars"></div>

<main class="seer-main">
  <section class="seer-header">
    <div class="seer-title-row">
      <div class="seer-title-icon"></div>
      <h1 class="seer-title">THE SEER</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="seer-subtitle">
      A quiet oracle at the center of DreamMeaningGuide—an eye that breathes, five uneven rays of meaning
      descending into your night, and a chamber that listens before it speaks.
    </p>
    <div class="seer-divider"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="seer-eye-apex">
    <div class="seer-svg-wrap">
      <svg class="seer-svg" viewBox="0 0 240 240">
        <circle cx="120" cy="90" r="52" fill="none" stroke="#8f7fff" stroke-width="6" />
        <circle cx="120" cy="90" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="5" />
        <circle cx="120" cy="90" r="16" fill="#050514" />
        <circle cx="114" cy="84" r="5" fill="rgba(243, 201, 122, 0.8)" />
        <path d="M40 90 Q120 20 200 90 Q120 160 40 90Z"
              fill="none" stroke="#8f7fff" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="120" y1="112" x2="120" y2="210"
              stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 16" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="120" y1="112" x2="98"  y2="200"
              stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 16" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="120" y1="112" x2="142" y2="215"
              stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 16" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="120" y1="112" x2="82"  y2="210"
              stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 16" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="120" y1="112" x2="168" y2="205"
              stroke="#f3c97a" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="8 16" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="seer-base-grid">
    <section class="seer-panel">
      <h2 class="seer-panel-title">Offer a dream to The Seer</h2>
      <p class="seer-panel-sub">
        Describe a single image, scene, or feeling from your dream. The Seer will not explain it away;
        it will offer a sentence that lets the symbol keep breathing.
      </p>

      <textarea id="seer-input" class="seer-input"
        placeholder="For example: I was walking through a flooded library, and every book was humming softly."></textarea>

      <div class="seer-actions">
        <button id="seer-button" class="seer-button">Listen to The Seer</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seer-panel">
      <h2 class="seer-panel-title">The Seer replies</h2>
      <p class="seer-panel-sub">
        The Seer speaks in one sentence at a time—enough to move with you, not enough to close the symbol.
      </p>

      <div id="seer-output-shell" class="seer-output-shell">
        <div class="seer-output-glow"></div>
        <div class="seer-output-label">Night‑oracle response</div>
        <div id="seer-output-text" class="seer-output-text"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</main>

<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    const input = document.getElementById("seer-input");
    const button = document.getElementById("seer-button");
    const outputShell = document.getElementById("seer-output-shell");
    const outputText = document.getElementById("seer-output-text");
    const starsContainer = document.query

